        "content": "Here are all the pending items requested since then, starting with Data & Core Fixes:\n\nBake in your 26 backup records: Package your uploaded JSON as the app's permanent default data so deployed users start with all your records, while keeping them 100% editable.\nSanitize \"Lovable\": Correct the spelling to \"Lovable\" in all 6 affected records and remove any trace of \"Lovable\" from dropdowns and filters.\nCalendar popover picker: Replace the hidden date picker with an interactive popover calendar so clicking the calendar icon lets you select dates with the mouse.\nCloud Services accounts: Add the 8 Google Account options (RB, RB54, 15D, PDS, RAS, PAD, RJB, RetroRick, + Custom) beside each Cloud Services checkbox.\nGlobal custom sync: Adding or deleting a custom field in any record automatically updates across all records and filter lists.\n\nThought for 6s\nHere are the remaining items for In-App UI & Exports: 6. Move Save buttons: Place \"Save to PDF\" and \"Save Spreadsheet\" next to the \"Help\" button to save an entire row and pull the header up. 7. Filter reset button: Add a single reset icon button right on the filter row to restore all filters and sorting to default. 8. Remove bottom Sort tab: Remove the obsolete \"Sort\" tab from the bottom navigation bar. 9. Rename to Last Request Date: Rename both \"Latest Update\" (cover) and \"Current Request Date\" (inside) to \"Last Request Date\". 10. Internal modified timestamp: Add a small italic cyan timestamp on the bottom-left icon row (below Google Account), updating only when edited and excluded from PDFs. 11. Export dropdowns & 2-column PDF: Add dropdown options (App Summary vs All Fields, All vs Filtered) to both Save buttons, and format the PDF into a clean 8.5\u00d711 mirrored 2-column layout with dynamic titles.",
